  "body": "The example `examples/guide-multiaxis.camproj` keeps a cached `FirstTraverseLow` warning for \"Indexed Face1\" in the old form. The old form gives the heights in the local frame of the tilted plane: `height_mm: 10.0`, `top_mm: 11.114`, `tilted: false`.\n\nSince #3080 (#2991), a regenerate gives this warning in the user's frame with `tilted: true`. The guide `site/content/guide/multi-axis/indexed.md` documents the two forms (30 mm and 31.114 mm, a raise of 1.114 mm).\n\nThe test `guide_projects::indexed_guide_preserves_legacy_basis_and_path` reads the old form through `same_warning` (#3233).\n\nDone means:\n- Regenerate the example through its own path, so that the cache has the new warning form.\n- Change only the warning fields. The posted `.nc` output stays byte-identical.\n- The guide test stays green.\n",
